The full portfolio gives the same fund result as the instrument selection.

========== API ==========

investmentPerformance({ accounts: ['^Assets:'], commodities: ['FUND'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.00 FUND
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:Other
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Unrelated
account Equity:Opening
account Income:Gains
account Expenses:Fees
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  1 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -100 USD

P 2024-01-01 FUND 120 USD
2024-01-02 Sale
  Assets:Broker  -0.5 FUND {100 USD} @ 130 USD
  Assets:Cash  65 USD
  Income:Gains  -15 USD
P 2024-01-02 FUND 140 USD

